<title>HONG KONG: Tysan Holdings interim net rises 25.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Tysan Holdings interim net rises 25.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.7   vs  10.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.6    vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    51.62  vs  41.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     421.44 vs  346.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tysan Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 11-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Tysan Holdings engages in foundation piling business, property development and machinery hiring.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
